# Response headers added by the asset layer; see README.md ("Deploy").
# Feeds are for readers, not search results. Without noindex, Search Console
# lists every feed as "Crawled - currently not indexed", which is harmless but
# hides real problems in the same report. `*` matches any run of characters,
# so one rule covers the site feed, every section feed and every tag feed,
# whichever sections or taxonomies enable feeds.
/*atom.xml
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
